	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p8418">Osvaldo Myconio</persName> <persName ref="p495">H. Bullingerus</persName> gratiam <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et pacem a domino optat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Miraris, scio, vivam<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ne an vita sim functus, quod nihil literarum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ad te dederim hactenus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Verum brevibus nunc <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sartio, quod hactenus non inimicitia aut neglectu, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sed per negotia est diminutum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ergo te cum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tuis recte valere opto.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nam ego una cum tota <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>mea familia et fratribus aliis charissimis, deo <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sit laus et gloria, recte valeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Litteras de <placeName ref="l41">Bernensi</placeName> synodo scriptas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> hatte <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> am 4. Oktober über die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Sondersynode vom September unterrichtet; s. oben <ref target="file11095">Nr. 1052</ref>.</note> accepi <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et legi lubens; illud imprimis, quod decreverunt <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>docere secundum confessionem et expositionem <placeName ref="l28">Basileien[sem]</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Gemeint ist das Erste <placeName ref="l862">Helvetische</placeName> Bekenntnis bzw. dessen Auslegung im Brief der reformierten Städte der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName> an <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> vom 12. Januar (vgl. oben <ref target="file10976">Nr. 934</ref>, Anm. 15).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>relinquere autem exotica et contentiosa ista <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>verba "substantialiter", "corporaliter", "carnaliter", "<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>supernaturaliter" etc.<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Dieser Beschluß der Frühjahrssynode war ausdrücklich erneuert und auch in das den <placeName ref="l491">Straßburgern</placeName> mitgegebene Zeugnis aufgenommen worden; vgl. <bibl source="b319">Hundeshagen</bibl> 76 und 89f, Anm. a.</note></s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Atque utinam hac responsione <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>contenti fuissent <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratenses</placeName>!</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Nam, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut libere, quod sentio, dicam, mallem ego tabulas <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>illas et ursum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Das mit dem <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Siegel versehene Zeugnis, dessen Abschrift <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> übermittelt hatte; s. oben <ref target="file11095">Nr. 1052</ref>, 8-10 mit Anm. 7.</note> neque petitas esse neque impet<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ratas.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Praesagit enim mens istos nescio quid <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>aliquando facturos, qui non contenti simplici <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>responsione fratrum, imo adeo anxie cupierunt etiam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>suam approbari confessionem<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11088">Nr. 1045</ref>, 192-194 mit Anm. 42.</note>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">An non satis vi<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>debatur facere confessio <placeName ref="l28">Basileiensis</placeName>?</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quid opus erat <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>texere novam?</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Et quis tandem erit confitendi <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>et subscribendi finis?</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Primo proponebatur <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>liber ad Monasterienses<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> "Bericht auß der heyligen geschrift..."; vgl. oben <ref target="file11096">Nr. 1053</ref>, 235-258.</note>, deinde <placeName ref="l28">Basileiensis</placeName><pb type="edition" next="294"/> con<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>fessio, hinc confessio 4 urbium,<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Die Confessio Tetrapolitana; vgl. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl>, <ref target="file10814">Nr. 776</ref>, S. 196-198 (bes. Anm. 1f).</note> postea con<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>fessio Saxonica cum sua apologia<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Das <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Bekenntnis und dessen Apologie; vgl. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl>, <ref target="file10904">Nr. 864</ref>, S. 364f.</note>, quinto <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>articuli a <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberga</placeName> allati<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Die <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberger</placeName> Konkordie.</note>, iam et Retractationum <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>quaesita est prope approbatio<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Die Reihenfolge läßt vermuten, daß <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> konkret an <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> Brief vom 27. Januar 1537 (oben <ref target="file10981">Nr. 939</ref>) denkt. Zwar verteidigte <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> darin seine "Retraktationen"; deren ausdrückliche Billigung verlangte er aber nicht.</note>; septimo <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>scripti sunt 3 articuli a <placeName ref="l1202">Schmalkaldia</placeName> per <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><persName ref="p467">Bucerum</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Gemeint sind die Ratschläge, die <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> seinem Bericht vom 1. April 1537 über den Bundestag zu <placeName ref="l1202">Schmalkalden</placeName> beifügte (s. oben <ref target="file11043">Nr. 1001</ref>, 26-36 mit Anm. 11).</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Hic iam <placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> etiam novam conscribit <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>confessionem, obscuriorem libens dicerem, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>quam ego hactenus viderim ullam.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ad haec obstu<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>pescimus nos, subscribimus, approbamus omnia.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Et mira profecto hic est patientia nostra.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ideo perpe<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>tuis incursionibus misere divexamur indi<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>es.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ego quod semel confessus sum in <placeName ref="l28">Ba<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>sileiensi</placeName> confessione et expositione ad doctorem <persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>iterum confiteor nec plura confitebor.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Scribant <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>alii mille confessiones; haec una satis mihi erit <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>pro multis milibus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Interim non probabo <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>aut improbabo cuilibet suas confessiones <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>privatas.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quae autem intelligo cum hac nostra non<pb type="scan" next="||244v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>pugnare, non reiicio; <persName ref="p467">Buceri</persName>, ita me deus amet, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>non intelligo.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Nescio, quo spectet.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Haec in sinum <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>amici effundo.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tu ferre nosti meam <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>simplicitatem.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Interim non est, quod metuas <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>tragoedias novas.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Pacifici sumus.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Concordiae <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>porro studebimus.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Caeterum illos novos motus <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>et conatus nequaquam probavero.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Deus novit cor <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>meum, quid spectem; is iudicabit in extremo <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>die.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Scripsi <persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName> me non perinde sua <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>intelligere, <persName ref="p2095">Melanchtonis</persName> intelligere et placere, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>quae scripsit in Locis communibus de <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>sacramentis<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Siehe oben <ref target="file11096">Nr. 1053</ref>, 221-232.</note>.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Boni, opinor, consulit <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>quae amicus scribit ad amicum.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Obsecro autem, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>ut has ad <persName ref="p467">Bucerum</persName> et <persName ref="p5565">Capitonem</persName> scriptas<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Mit den beiden Briefen an <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> vom 6. und 15. Oktober (oben <ref target="file11096">Nr. 1053</ref> und 1055) wurde demnach auch ein nicht erhaltenes Schreiben an <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName> übersandt.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>bona fide <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratum</placeName> perferri cures.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>4. novembris anno 1537.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/><persName ref="p495">H. Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Ohne Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
